{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"兩二手名牌店疑欠客人4200萬寄賣款項　逾300人報案\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/FRAUD-BAG-261119-20.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】兩間二手名牌店疑拖欠客人約4200萬寄賣款項，警方接獲303人報案。</p><p>其中一間涉案店舖位於銅鑼灣羅素街，截至傍晚6時，警方接獲207人報案，懷疑店舖拖欠約3000萬元寄賣款項。警方亦接獲96人報案，指金鐘海富中心一間二手名牌店，懷疑拖欠共約1190萬元寄賣款項，案件暫列欺詐，由灣仔及中區重案組跟進。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:57:35.283806+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T12:19:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T17:14:25.116781+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T12:51:02.935423+00:00","content_hash":"360b87655b338a113adcc061a1f5e07417bc366bd176519a5902d6539b18cbed","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:57:35.283806+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}